+// RewindBox (patch 0023): diagnostics for the port of seedds/nxnative's placement sparse textures (patches 0028 on). Two kinds of log line; nothing here changes what is made,
+//   uploaded or kept resident, and nothing is created on the GPU.
+// (a) rb_sp_device_line, once at the end of mtl_init: what this GPU answers for Metal placement sparse textures. Upstream makes a sparse texture placement sparse only where
+//   Metal's 64 KB tile is NVN's, and measured Metal's tiles on an M6 only (seedds/nxnative 1d4b8e82: dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m:3406-3414, and sparse_make's query :3536-3537,
+//   at 0c078130; MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 seedds). The line gives that query's answer (a 2D array, 64 KB pages) for the pixel formats S2Arm makes for Mario Kart World's terrain
+//   arrays (ASTC 8x8 sRGB for 0x8e, BC6H UFLOAT for 0x50 where S2Arm keeps BC native, RGBA8 SNORM for 0x26), for ASTC 8x8 LDR and for the other texel sizes (R8, R16, RG16,
+//   RGBA16F), beside NVN's public answer for the same texture (nvn_tex_sparse_layout, by which the game lays out and maps its tiles; patch 0012). Each format's pixel format is
+//   taken as tex_desc takes it (nvn_fmt_to_mtl, then fmt_unpack: BC decoded where no_bc says so, DM_TEST_NO_BC included, and the expanded formats); one S2Arm stores in another
+//   format is not asked. supportsPlacementSparse (iOS / macOS 26.4) is read by name, -1 when this OS has no such property, so the line does not depend on the SDK it is built
+//   with. Metal has no device-wide sparse tier: MTLTexture.sparseTextureTier needs a texture, which this line does not make
+// (b) res_top, through rb_res_top_check: the residency set by kind and its largest allocations, in one line, when the process's footprint has risen by RB_TOP_STEP since the last
+//   such line (the first time: since the device line), or since the footprint last fell more than a step below that (a texture's staging retired, a session parked or ended:
+//   patch 0010). Asked at the start of a submission (at most every RB_TOP_EVERY_NS) and after the lines of patches 0020-0022; and, whatever the growth, at Metal's first refusal
+//   of a staging buffer (in one piece, pkg_upload_, or a piece, rb_up_refused) and at the first command buffer error that says OutOfMemory (mtl_gpu_cb_error, every queue);
+//   at most RB_TOP_LINES lines, and those two forced ones even past that. Mario Kart World, IPA 741: the footprint went from 4793 MB at frame 584 to 5773 MB at frame 588 (two heartbeat lines 10 s apart) and no line said
+//   what took it; the memory line of nvn_be_mem_stat comes every 300 frames, too late for that.
+//   Ported (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 seedds) from seedds/nxnative 1d4b8e82 res_top and res_top_once (dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m:470-497 at 0c078130). Upstream logs it at the first GPU
